{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04903","headline":"奉和初春幸太平公主南庄应制 · 李乂","name":"奉和初春幸太平公主南庄应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平阳馆外有仙家，沁水园中好物华。\n地出东郊回日御，城临南斗度云车。\n风泉韵绕幽林竹，雨霰光摇杂树花。\n已庆时来千亿寿，还言日暮九重赊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李乂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04903.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04903","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}